      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.26 (vs ₹1.14 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.26 (up from ₹1.14 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹761.0m (up 21% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹64.3m (up 10% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 8.4% (down from 9.2% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 2% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 7% per year.",
